Q4.)     What is the difference between list and sets?

Ans4-    Set:- A set is an unordered, collection of objects with no index assigned
               It does not allow a duplicate value in it
               It is represented by {}
         List:-A list is a ordered, indexed collection of objects
               It allows duplicates of other values in it
               It is represented by []
         
